OL,3,GNEWSAMan died after being 'crushed' on
OL,4,Ahousing site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died after being "crushed" on a
OL,7,Fnew housing development where he was
OL,8,Fdelivering building supplies, an
OL,9,Finquest has heard.
OL,11,FNigel Williamson, 60, died at the
OL,12,FKneeton Grove housing development in
OL,13,FEast Bridgford, on 13 August last year,
OL,14,Fwhile working as a delivery driver for
OL,15,FKRM Building Supplies.
OL,17,FNottingham Coroners' Court heard on
OL,18,FMonday how Williamson was found lying
OL,19,Fon the flatbed of a crane-mounted lorry
OL,20,Fin pain before he suffered a cardiac
OL,21,Farrest.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
