OL,3,GNEWSAMan died after being 'crushed' on
OL,4,Ahousing site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury was told that Williamson had
OL,7,Fbeen employed by KRM Building Supplies
OL,8,Ffor about two and half weeks at the
OL,9,Ftime and that a supervisor, who would
OL,10,Fordinarily have been with him for a
OL,11,Fsix-week period, was on leave with no
OL,12,Freplacement.
